  <li
    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Map_of_Ur_III.svg/120px-Map_of_Ur_III.svg.png" alt="Empire of the Third Dynasty of Ur. West is at top, north at right." height="120" width="105"

    Empire of the Third Dynasty of Ur. West is at top, north at right.

